Potential responsibilities include:

- Architecture and planning.
- Programming.
- Code review.
- Research.
- Documentation.
- Debugging.
- Independent opinions.
- Testing proposed solutions.

A major realization:

Even a relatively simple task can develop into a much deeper exploration when multiple AI systems contribute different perspectives.

The founder particularly values the ability to see what happens when several assistants collaborate.

## Collaboration philosophy

AI assistants should not operate as isolated authorities.

They should be able to examine shared project information, understand existing decisions, contribute improvements, and explain their reasoning.

The human founder remains the decision-maker.

Project information should be written in formats that different AI systems can understand.

We should not depend on any one assistant remembering everything.

External documentation is the common ground.

